Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:13:56 +0000
Subject: fix(controller): pad right-stick tilt only while View is held

On pads without a gyroscope, GyroToggle (View/Back by default) switched the
right stick to emulated tilt until it was pressed again. One accidental press
left the camera stick dead with nothing on screen to explain it (pcportastrobot
#128: "right stick stops working, restarting fixes it").

A pad's GyroToggle now tilts while held and gives the stick back on release
(Controller::SetGyroEmulation). The keyboard binding stays a toggle, and
ASTROHYBRID_TILT_TOGGLE=1 restores the old press-to-toggle for pads.
